    <p class="ltlNotes">
      <span class="cautionColor">Please note that due to software reporting 
        limitations some precincts may show that their results are 100% 
        complete yet that may only be a partial result for that contest or 
        reporting unit.</span> Many of our municipalities have multiple 
      reporting units, multiple ballot tabulators, and/or utilize Central 
      Count. Therefore, these municipalities’ voter totals from their polling 
      sites or the totals from their central count locations will be reported 
      separately and their results totaled at the end of the evening.
      <span class="cautionColor">Do not consider any results as fully 
        reported until the County’s election posting reads "Unofficial Results 
        – Final".</span> 
      If you have any questions or want to verify if results are complete, 
      call or text the County Clerk's Office at (262) 666-3335.
    </p>
  

